title: Internet of things
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Think about all of your stuff, then, think about all of it collecting data and connected to the internet to store and share that data with all your other stuff. 

aka [[IoT]]

Physical things out in the real world, embedded with various kinds of sensors, communicating with databases/computers, remote digital monitoring and control…

Think of all the [[Nest]] and [[HomePod]] and other things
